<title>USA: TABLE - Nu Horizons Q1 shr profit narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Nu Horizons Q1 shr profit narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					   5/31/97		  5/31/96</p>
<p> Net sales			  $54,165,706	   $57,672,540</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		  42,223,252	    44,746,424</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	    9,097,921	     8,373,949</p>
<p> Operating income		   2,844,533	     4,552,167</p>
<p> Interest expense		     326,893		 433,128</p>
<p>Income before provision for</p>
<p> income taxes			 2,517,640	     4,119,039</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes     1,015,252	     1,664,102</p>
<p> Net income			   1,502,388	     2,454,937</p>
<p>Earnings per share:</p>
<p> Primary				     0.17		    0.27</p>
<p> Fully diluted			     0.15		    0.25</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding:</p>
<p> Primary				8,832,323	     9,130,000</p>
<p> Fully diluted		     10,818,859	    10,409,109</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Nu Horizons Electronics Corp.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
